{title: Mana Ke Hum Yaar Nahi}
{artist: Parineeti Chopra Sonu Nigam Sachin Jigar}
{key: G#}

{c: Verse 1}
Maana ke hum [G#] yaar nahin,        Lo tay hai ke [C#] pyaar nahi.. [A#m]
Phir bhi [Fm] nazre na tum [C#] milana,        Dil ka [D#] aitbaar [G#] nahi
Mana ke hum [G#] yaar nahi..        [G#] Raaste mein [C#] jo milo toh
[D#] Haath milaane [G#] ruk jaana,        [G#] Saath mein koi [C#] ho tumhare
[D#] Door se hi tum [G#] muskaana,        Lekin [G#] muskaan ho aisi
Ki jisme [C#] ikraar nahi.. [A#m],        Nazron se na [Fm] karna tum [C#] bayaan
Woh jise [D#] inkaar [G#] nahi,        Mana ke hum [G#] yaar nahi..
[G#] Phool jo band hai [C#] panno me,        Tum [D#] usko dhool [G#] bana dena
[G#] Baat chhide jo [C#] meri kahin,        Tum [D#] usko bhool [G#] bataa dena
Lekin [G#] wo bhool ho aisi,        Jis?se [C#] bezaar nahin.. [A#m]
Tu jo [Fm] soye toh meri [C#] tarah,        Ik pal ko bhi [D#] karaar [G#] nahin
Mana ke hum [G#] yaar nahi..
